><mn>26</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>19</mn><msup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">(</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>12</mn><mn>13</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>9.81</mn><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mtext>kg</mtext><mo>,</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>rounded to two decimal places.</p>\n</div></div>",
