ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mi>t</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\">∫</mo><mn>0.6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mi>t</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.6</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mi>C</mi><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Note that <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"523\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is a constant of integration.</p>\n<p>We're told that the vat initially contains <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"524\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c cla