mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6D\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c69\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd></mjx-mtr></mjx-itable></mjx-table></mjx-mtable></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mtable displaystyle=\"true\" columnalign=\"right left\" columnspacing=\"0em\" rowspacing=\"0.8em 0.8em 0.8em 0.8em 0.3em\"><mtr><mtd><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>160</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>100</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>160</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>100</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>160</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>60</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mtext>min</mtext><mo>.</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Finally, rounded to one decimal place, the amount of salt in the reservoir at the moment it begins to overflow is</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"637\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 16.196em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0px; p