false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>150</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>60</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>150</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>60</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>150</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>90</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mtext>min</mtext><mo>.</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Finally, rounded to one decimal place, the amount of ink dye in the reservoir at the moment it begins to overflow is</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"743\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 16.196em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0.4em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D444 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 0px; padding-bottom: 0.4em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\">